+---
+id: task-003-make-applypatch-conform-to-rfc-6902
+type: task
+title: "Make applyPatch conform to RFC 6902"
+status: pending
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+Reviewed `applyPatch` against RFC 6902. Found and fixed two deviations:
+
+- `replace` was implemented as remove + add, which moved an object member to the end; it now replaces the value in place (RFC 4.3 "replaces the value"; key order is kept).
+- Operations were applied with `Array.prototype.reduce`, which skips holes, so a sparse patch was silently accepted; operations are now iterated by index, so a hole is rejected as a non-object operation.
+
+Test added in `test/patch.test.ts`; all tests pass.
